CinnabarIsland_Mart_Text_DontTheyHaveXAttack::
    .string "Don't they have X ATTACK?\p"
    .string "I like it because it raises the\n"
    .string "ATTACK stat in battle.$"

CinnabarIsland_Mart_Text_ExtraItemsNeverHurt::
    .string "It never hurts to have extra items.\n"
    .string "You never know what might happen.$"


CinnabarIsland_Mart_Text_ScientistAsk::
    .string "We are testing REPEL on the volcano\n"
    .string "bugs. I'm out of samples.\pThree REPELS would finish my\n"
    .string "research, young one.$"

CinnabarIsland_Mart_Text_ScientistOffer::
    .string "REPELS! Could you give me three\n"
    .string "for my research?$"

CinnabarIsland_Mart_Text_ScientistGives::
    .string "Fascinating! They flee beautifully!\pTake this from the lab stock. It\n"
    .string "was meant for the trial group.$"

CinnabarIsland_Mart_Text_ScientistNo::
    .string "Hm. Science will wait, I suppose.$"
